### Obtener archivos adjuntos de un job — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getFiles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getFiles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1
}

### Validación: sin jobId → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getFiles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Validación: jobId menor o igual a 0 → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getFiles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 0
}

### Job inexistente: devuelve lista vacía — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getFiles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 999999999
}
